&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: -16px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;; color: #262626"&gt;・生物多様性&lt;/span&gt;
